evidence":["yuanzhang-q-d1937f349beb241cef91"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-502c462bc7ea4c1b9161","label":"正文","text":"世子以畴同于子文辞禄申胥逃赏宜勿夺，荀彧、钟繇亦以为可听","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-bdadbd27620c03f6d672","label":"正文","text":"太祖犹欲侯田畴，语夏侯惇且往以情喻之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-0a8c77e13a53762c1177"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-a60c3ce79b24cf25124c","label":"正文","text":"夏侯惇就田畴宿，畴揣知其指不复发言；惇临去拊畴背问主意殷勤曾不能顾乎","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-baae8d65d6a6a35918ca"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-4ea2172fac5539cf4f08","label":"正文","text":"田畴答岂可卖卢龙之塞以易赏禄，若必不得已请愿效死刎首于前，涕泣横流，惇具答太祖","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-dbab9c0526cd06602022"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-e03a57091ec631191215","label":"正文","text":"太祖喟然知田畴不可屈，乃拜为议郎","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-124d25ea8c111dd570b4"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-0957964659b7473e08c4","label":"裴注·先贤行状","text":"太祖表论田畴之功，历数其避难无终山、拒守要害、拒袁氏之召、军次易县长驱自到、使部曲持露布诱胡众、帅兵五百启导山谷，遂灭乌丸荡平塞表","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-ab94b740980f3d576e56"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-3c2d80d1ad4ae4e3ce58","label":"裴注·魏书","text":"太祖下令听田畴所执，以昔伯成弃国夏后不夺为喻","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-6eebab8389812fa280c9"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-cec40e819c57a2835f12","label":"裴注·先贤行状","text":"太祖令历数田畴至节之功与前后辞赏，谓成一人之高甚违王典，宜从表封","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-066dade5e4916e1bd65f"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-5b008c2093417492f934","label":"裴注·魏书","text":"世子议以昔薳敖逃禄传载其美，至于田畴方斯近矣，免官加刑于法为重","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-7d634095be50cbc49ebc"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-b21d16e34611c048f6ac","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"教以夷齐弃爵讥武王孔子犹以为求仁得仁，田畴所守虽不合道但欲清高耳，外议虽善为复使令、司隶以决之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-50130c5b3331eed81fa9"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-d17848ad982c39ef4503","label":"裴注·魏书","text":"荀彧议以为君子之道或出或处期于为善而已，匹夫守志圣人各因而成之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-952c37629d1c98147f72"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-52053e0271a2f3ffada2","label":"裴注·魏书","text":"钟繇以为原思辞粟仲尼不与、子路拒牛谓之止善，田畴虽不合大义有益推让之风，宜如世子议","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-274d4eba12d683767416"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"封田畴亭侯邑五百户，知其至心，许而不夺；追念畴功殊美，恨前听畴之让，曰是成一人之志而亏王法大制，复以前爵封畴；不听，欲引拜之，至于数四；重其事，依违者久之，乃下世子及大臣博议；犹欲侯田畴，语夏侯惇且往以情喻之，自从君所言，无告吾意；喟然知不可屈，拜田畴为议郎；表论田畴之功，称其文雅优备忠武又著，诚应宠赏以旌其美；下令昔伯成弃国夏后不夺，将欲使高尚之士优贤之主不止于一世，其听田畴所执；下令称蓨令田畴至节高尚，引身深山命召不屈，陈建攻胡蹊路开塞导送，斩蹋顿于白狼遂长驱柳城；畴恳恻前后辞赏，出入三载历年未赐，成一人之高甚违王典，宜从表封无久留吾过","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-ec6796ec42e2a9fcb9ca","yuanzhang-q-c2281ab23c16bef3e355","yuanzhang-q-fb5babf9fab2a2dc340b","yuanzhang-q-d1937f349beb241cef91","yuanzhang-q-0a8c77e13a53762c1177","yuanzhang-q-124d25ea8c111dd570b4","yuanzhang-q-ab94b740980f3d576e56","yuanzhang-q-6eebab8389812fa280c9","yuanzhang-q-066dade5e4916e1bd65f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0243","role":"自以始为君难率众遁逃志义不立，反以为利非本意，固让；从征荆州还；上疏陈诚，以死自誓，终不受；被劾狷介违道苟立小节，宜免官加刑；议其封爵宜勿夺；揣知其指，不复发言；答称负义逃窜之人蒙恩全活，岂可卖卢龙之塞以易赏禄，若必不得已请愿效死刎首于前，言未卒涕泣横流；被拜为议郎；被表论其率宗人避难于无终山、北拒卢龙、前后召而不陷挠、长驱自到陈讨胡之势、启导山谷灭乌丸之功；辞让之志被听许；被令宜从表封；所守被教评议","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-ec6796ec42e2a9fcb9ca","yuanzhang-q-c2281ab23c16bef3e355","yuanzhang-q-fb5babf9fab2a2dc340b","yuanzhang-q-d1937f349beb241cef91","yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9","yuanzhang-q-baae8d65d6a6a35918ca","yuanzhang-q-dbab9c0526cd06602022","yuanzhang-q-124d25ea8c111dd570b4","yuanzhang-q-ab94b740980f3d576e56","yuanzhang-q-6eebab8389812fa280c9","yuanzhang-q-066dade5e4916e1bd65f","yuanzhang-q-50130c5b3331eed81fa9"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"以田畴同于子文辞禄、申胥逃赏，宜勿夺以优其节；议薳敖逃禄传载其美，激浊世励贪夫，贤于尸禄素餐之人，故可得而小不可得而毁，至于田畴方斯近矣，免官加刑于法为重","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9","yuanzhang-q-7d634095be50cbc49ebc"]},{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"亦以为可听；议以为君子之道或出或处期于为善而已，故匹夫守志，圣人各因而成之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9","yuanzhang-q-952c37629d1c98147f72"]},{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"亦以为可听；以为原思辞粟仲尼不与，子路拒牛谓之止善，虽可激清励浊犹不足多，畴虽不合大义有益推让之风，宜如世子议","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9","yuanzhang-q-274d4eba12d683767416"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"受命往喻田畴；如太祖所戒就田畴宿，临去拊其背问之；具答太祖","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-0a8c77e13a53762c1177","yuanzhang-q-baae8d65d6a6a35918ca","yuanzhang-q-dbab9c0526cd06602022"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-ec6796ec42e2a9fcb9ca","yuanzhang-q-c2281ab23c16bef3e355","yuanzhang-q-fb5babf9fab2a2dc340b","yuanzhang-q-d1937f349beb241cef91","yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9","yuanzhang-q-0a8c77e13a53762c1177","yuanzhang-q-baae8d65d6a6a35918ca","yuanzhang-q-dbab9c0526cd06602022","yuanzhang-q-124d25ea8c111dd570b4","yuanzhang-q-ab94b740980f3d576e56","yuanzhang-q-6eebab8389812fa280c9","yuanzhang-q-066dade5e4916e1bd65f","yuanzhang-q-7d634095be50cbc49ebc","yuanzhang-q-50130c5b3331eed81fa9","yuanzhang-q-952c37629d1c98147f72","yuanzhang-q-274d4eba12d683767416"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-ec6796ec42e2a9fcb9ca","source_order":[11,231,0],"order":2586}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0027","name":"夏侯惇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0100","name":"荀彧","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0181","name":"钟繇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0243","name":"田畴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-066dade5e4916e1bd65f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-bf5f1ac510be6d850f7c","layer":"pei","quote":"蓨令田畴，至节高尚。遭值州里，戎夏交乱；引身深山，研精味道；百姓从之，以成都邑。袁贼之盛，命召不屈；慷慨守志，以邀真主。及孤奉诏，征定河北，遂服幽都；将定胡寇，（时）〔特〕加礼命。畴即受署，陈建攻胡蹊路所由；率齐山民，一时向化；开塞导送，供承使役；路近而便，令虏不意；斩蹋顿于白狼，遂长驱于柳城：畴有力焉。及军入塞，将图其功，表封亭侯，食邑五百；而畴恳恻，前后辞赏。出入三载，历年未赐；此为成一人之高，甚违王典，失之多矣。宜从表封，无久留吾过","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7c973e3821770b49ed4d","start":21,"end":242,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-0a8c77e13a53762c1177","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2753ebfeb4967f394d4d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖犹欲侯之。畴素与夏侯惇善，太祖语惇曰：“且往，以情喻之。自从君所言，无告吾意也","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":114,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-124d25ea8c111dd570b4","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-fd16eacf6e199160494f","layer":"original","quote":"太祖喟然知不可屈，乃拜为议郎","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":234,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-274d4eba12d683767416","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-943015795a39588439f9","layer":"pei","quote":"钟繇以为：“原思辞粟，仲尼不与；子路拒牛，谓之止善；虽可以激清励浊，犹不足多也。畴虽不合大义，有益推让之风。宜如世子议","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7fb3718dfb307f0597e5","start":144,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-4e1eb31472fcdbebfbd9","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2753ebfeb4967f394d4d","layer":"original","quote":"世子以“畴同于子文辞禄〖8〗，申胥逃赏〖9〗；宜勿夺，以优其节”。尚书令荀彧、司隶校尉钟繇亦以为“可听","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":58,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-50130c5b3331eed81fa9","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-943015795a39588439f9","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏略》载教曰：“昔夷、齐弃爵而讥武王，可谓愚暗，孔子犹以为‘求仁得仁’。畴之所守，虽不合道，但欲清高耳。使天下悉如畴志，即墨翟兼爱尚同之事，而老聃使民结绳之道也。外议虽善，为复使令、司隶以决之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7fb3718dfb307f0597e5","start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6eebab8389812fa280c9","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-7dd5e2dfac73f31d5101","layer":"pei","quote":"昔伯成弃国，夏后不夺；将欲使高尚之士，优贤之主，不止于一世也。其听畴所执","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-faeccfc7360694b7413b","start":14,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-7d634095be50cbc49ebc","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-7906a8f9d0fc72a6f52a","layer":"pei","quote":"昔薳敖逃禄，传载其美；所以激浊世，励贪夫，贤于尸禄素餐之人也。故可得而小，不可得而毁；至于田畴，方斯近矣。免官加刑，于法为重","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7fb3718dfb307f0597e5","start":14,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-952c37629d1c98147f72","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-943015795a39588439f9","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》载荀彧议，以为：“君子之道，或出或处，期于为善而已。故匹夫守志，圣人各因而成之","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7fb3718dfb307f0597e5","start":99,"end":142,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ab94b740980f3d576e56","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-e8f8a38018b243935d43","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖表论畴功曰：‘文雅优备，忠武又著；和于抚下，慎于事上；量时度理，进退合义。幽州始扰，胡、汉交瘁；荡析离居，靡所依怀。畴率宗人，避难于无终山，北拒卢龙，南守要害；清静隐约，耕而后食；人民化从，咸共资奉。及袁绍父子威力加于朔野，远结乌丸，与为首尾；前后召畴，终不陷挠。后臣奉命，军次易县；畴长驱自到，陈讨胡之势：犹广武之建燕策，薛公之度淮南。又使部曲持臣露布，出诱胡众；汉民或因亡来，乌丸闻之震荡。王旅出塞，途由山中九百余里；畴帅兵五百，启导山谷：遂灭乌丸，荡平塞表。畴文武有效，节义可嘉；诚应宠赏，以旌其美","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":254,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c9b87fe0f245e52293f4","start":12,"end":266,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-baae8d65d6a6a35918ca","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-7ff395105ff179cb6243","layer":"original","quote":"惇就畴宿，如太祖所戒〖10〗。畴揣知其指，不复发言。惇临去，乃拊畴背曰：“田君！主意殷勤〖11〗，曾不能顾乎","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-c2281ab23c16bef3e355","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-7b93f1965a3a54beb7b1","layer":"original","quote":"从征荆州还。太祖追念畴功殊美，恨前听畴之让。曰：“是成一人之志，而亏王法大制也！”于是乃复以前爵封畴","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-d1937f349beb241cef91","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-2753ebfeb4967f394d4d","layer":"original","quote":"有司劾畴：“狷介违道〖4〗，苟立小节；宜免官，加刑。”太祖重其事〖5〗，依违者久之〖6〗，乃下世子及大臣博议","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-dbab9c0526cd06602022","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-7ff395105ff179cb6243","layer":"original","quote":"畴答曰：“是何言之过也〖12〗！畴，负义逃窜之人耳；蒙恩全活，为幸多矣；岂可卖卢龙之塞，以易赏禄哉〖13〗！纵国私畴〖14〗，畴独不愧于心乎？将军雅知畴者〖15〗，犹复如此；若必不得已，请愿效死刎首于前〖16〗！”言未卒，涕泣横流。惇具答太祖","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":56,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ec6796ec42e2a9fcb9ca","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-980722d8367b4a4376f3","layer":"original","quote":"军还，入塞，论功行封。封畴亭侯，邑五百户。﹝一﹞畴自以始为（居）〔君〕难〖1〗，率众遁逃，志义不立；反以为利，非本意也，固让。太祖知其至心，许而不夺","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-fb5babf9fab2a2dc340b","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-7b93f1965a3a54beb7b1","layer":"original","quote":"畴上疏陈诚〖3〗，以死自誓。太祖不听，欲引拜之；至于数四，终不受","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
